{"3661410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Neighborhood Watchers", "steam_appid": 3661410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661410/extras/684b76820c316ddcdb45fc18e750aa4b.avif?t=1788122079\" alt=\"Section heading: Move Into the Neighborhood.\" width=616 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neighborhood Watchers is a spooky-cozy co-op world for 1–4 players. Settle into a strange little 90s neighborhood where odd critters covet the memories of mysterious, missing people. Build and decorate your home on the same street as your friends, and then sneak through haunted houses, fighting your way through dark streets to recover that which is lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661410/extras/b1369e4269a738e49227a9b8ab3be566.poster.avif?t=1788122079\" aria-label=\"A small white moving truck drives down a foggy, tree-lined neighborhood street.\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661410/extras/b1369e4269a738e49227a9b8ab3be566.webm?t=1788122079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661410/extras/b1369e4269a738e49227a9b8ab3be566.mp4?t=1788122079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661410/extras/7b4cc180cacfe6212460aabbd62476f6.avif?t=1788122079\" alt=\"Section heading: Make Yourself at Home.\" width=616 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish, farm, shop for new outfits, or decorate your house. The memories you recover help restore the neighborhood, piece by piece.  Before long, it'll start to feel like home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661410/extras/691e44c1310380aa82c2e3726a56c460.poster.avif?t=1788122079\" aria-label=\"A bucket-headed player casts a fishing line from a stone walkway beside dark water.\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661410/extras/691e44c1310380aa82c2e3726a56c460.webm?t=1788122079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661410/extras/691e44c1310380aa82c2e3726a56c460.mp4?t=1788122079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661410/extras/14108c1d095c6b9a996d8ac42c03c0dc.avif?t=1788122079\" alt=\"Section heading: Survive the Haunted House.\" width=616 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore procedurally generated haunted houses. Crouch, crawl, and sneak past the twisted monstrosities inside. Discover what it takes to lift the curse on each house, reclaim the memories left behind, and prepare for a harrowing escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661410/extras/871cad4027fac2f859582866a8c18a4c.poster.avif?t=1788122079\" aria-label=\"A giant spider crawls across a small bed inside a dark haunted house.\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661410/extras/871cad4027fac2f859582866a8c18a4c.webm?t=1788122079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661410/extras/871cad4027fac2f859582866a8c18a4c.mp4?t=1788122079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661410/extras/4a497b93500fe37acaa1402770970a25.avif?t=1788122079\" alt=\"Section heading: Get Out Together.\" width=616 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue lost spirit children and lead them home through the dangerous dark streets. Lean on your team — some fight off the shadows, others guide the spirits to safety — and escape together before the shadows close in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661410/extras/bef606fbe3aa96816360b50e00990bae.poster.avif?t=1788122079\" aria-label=\"A bucket-headed player dodges a shadow creature on a purple-lit street.\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661410/extras/bef606fbe3aa96816360b50e00990bae.webm?t=1788122079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661410/extras/bef606fbe3aa96816360b50e00990bae.mp4?t=1788122079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661410/extras/e9bfd4cbb1974982c3422eecea89bcd8.avif?t=1788122079\" alt=\"Section heading: Key Features.\" width=616 height=75 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op for 1–4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy neighborhood life: fish, farm, shop, meet your neighbors, and prep for the next haunted house</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim a plot, build your home, and decorate it inside and out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work your way through procedurally generated haunted houses, sneak past looming threats, and rescue lost spirits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up and fight your way through the dark streets, leading your friends and the lost spirits to safety</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661410/extras/322706a08a641d26039c093757fec222.poster.avif?t=1788122079\" aria-label=\"Three players explore a foggy, purple-lit mall.\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661410/extras/322706a08a641d26039c093757fec222.webm?t=1788122079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661410/extras/322706a08a641d26039c093757fec222.mp4?t=1788122079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661410/extras/684b76820c316ddcdb45fc18e750aa4b.avif?t=1788122079\" alt=\"Section heading: Move Into the Neighborhood.\" width=616 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neighborhood Watchers is a spooky-cozy co-op world for 1–4 players. Settle into a strange little 90s neighborhood where odd critters covet the memories of mysterious, missing people. Build and decorate your home on the same street as your friends, and then sneak through haunted houses, fighting your way through dark streets to recover that which is lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661410/extras/b1369e4269a738e49227a9b8ab3be566.poster.avif?t=1788122079\" aria-label=\"A small white moving truck drives down a foggy, tree-lined neighborhood street.\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661410/extras/b1369e4269a738e49227a9b8ab3be566.webm?t=1788122079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661410/extras/b1369e4269a738e49227a9b8ab3be566.mp4?t=1788122079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661410/extras/7b4cc180cacfe6212460aabbd62476f6.avif?t=1788122079\" alt=\"Section heading: Make Yourself at Home.\" width=616 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish, farm, shop for new outfits, or decorate your house. The memories you recover help restore the neighborhood, piece by piece.  Before long, it'll start to feel like home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661410/extras/691e44c1310380aa82c2e3726a56c460.poster.avif?t=1788122079\" aria-label=\"A bucket-headed player casts a fishing line from a stone walkway beside dark water.\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661410/extras/691e44c1310380aa82c2e3726a56c460.webm?t=1788122079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661410/extras/691e44c1310380aa82c2e3726a56c460.mp4?t=1788122079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661410/extras/1